{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["FAIRY TAIL × RAVE","In a town far away, Lucy, Natsu and Happy, from Mashima's Fairy Tail manga, are on a mission to find a troublemaker and deal with her. Due to unknown circumstances they get separated.\n\n\nThe same happens to Elie and Haru, from Mashima's Rave Master manga.\n\n\nLucy and Elie manage to meet each other and together they try to find their respective partners."],"ja":["FAIRY TAIL × RAVE",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-18393","ids":{"shikimori":18393,"mal":18393,"anilist":18393,"kodik":"movie-59414"},"kodikIds":["movie-51988","movie-59363","movie-59414"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-51988":"2020-03-18T21:13:59Z","movie-59363":"2020-08-24T10:53:58Z","movie-59414":"2020-08-25T08:03:07Z"},"title":"Хвост Феи x Рэйв","originalTitle":"Fairy Tail x Rave","alt":"FAIRY TAIL × RAVE","description":"В далеком городе Люси , Нацу и Хэппи из манги « Сказка о Хвосте феи » находятся на задании по поимке нарушителя спокойствия. Вследствие неизвестных обстоятельств Люси разделяется с друзьями. То же происходит с Эли и Хару из манги « Рэйв Мастер ». Люси и Эли встречаются и вместе пытаются найти своих напарников.","year":2013,"type":"OVA","genres":["Сёнен","Экшен","Приключения","Фэнтези"],"rating":7.14,"popularity":25149,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/18393/98def12f7d994a105527f31831961d85.jpeg","width":250,"height":350},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/1b3281de5f85fb650d67fa9e78d1a120407709ba.jpg","width":1024,"height":576}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-51988","translationId":"674","url":"https://kodikplayer.